 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "As level 1, but identifiers are compared after normalisation. Email: lower-case it, then in the part before \"@\" drop everything from the first \"+\" and remove every \".\"; the part after \"@\" is kept (lower-cased). Phone: keep only its digits. Account i registers when neither normalised identifier is already claimed; return the ascending indices of the duplicates.",
